ll=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="grp_63" target="grp_65"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="590" y="1787" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="660" y="1787" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_109" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=0;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2.6;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="grp_65" target="grp_67"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1190" y="1787" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1260" y="1787" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="grp_11" value="工程分离原则: agentic_workflow/ (LangGraph + Antigravity run_workflow 编排) ↔ output/ (7卷交付 + Zero-LLM 证据索引 + 原厂PDF规格书库 + 评分遥测)&#10;颜色图例: 深蓝=确定性代码/计算/验真 | 紫色=多角色智能体推理/撰写 | 绿=SQLite EvidenceVault/物理PDF库 | 暗红=异构Critic/100分Stage-Gate门禁 | 琥珀=右侧独立契约栏" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=46;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="30" width="2780" height="91" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="hdr_12" value="BoilerSense-AI™ 燃煤电站锅炉水冷壁 FBG 测温产品研发与量产导入多智能体拓扑图 (对齐《Agentic Design Patterns》21模式)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#0F172A;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="30" width="2780" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="grp_27" value="• 只读扫描 Boiler_FBG_Thermometry_Research/*.md&#10;• 写入 [EV-BASE-*] (保持原文件夹 0 修改)&#10;• 解除早期单一路线假定约束" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#064E3B;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=44;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="205" width="490" height="145" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="hdr_28" value="Stage 0a-1: 历史语料只读入库" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#065F46;strokeColor=#065F46;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="205" width="490" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="grp_29" value="• Metaso (CN): 煤电三改联动/爆管痛点/竞品&#10;• Serper (GL): Ibsen/Santec/FBGS/Lumentum&#10;• 写入 SQLite EvidenceVault" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=44;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="630" y="205" width="510" height="145" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="hdr_30" value="Stage 0a-2: 宏观市场 &amp; 器件侦察" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#1E3A8A;strokeColor=#1E3A8A;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="630" y="205" width="510" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="grp_31" value="• 应用 Step-Back Prompting 分解 6 研发赛道&#10;• 锁定 BS-STD-600 + BS-PRO-2000 双档路线&#10;• 输出 ProductDiscoveryPlan JSON" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#F5F3FF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#1E1B4B;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=44;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1210" y="205" width="590" height="145" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="hdr_32" value="Stage 0b: 首席产品经理 (Chief PM)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#5B21B6;strokeColor=#5B21B6;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1210" y="205" width="590" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="grp_33" value="煤电深调峰政策&#10;结焦爆管需求规模&#10;电力招标定价带" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#F5F3FF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWi